OL,3,GNEWSAMet says sex workers more willing
OL,4,Ato report crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police says more women
OL,7,Finvolved in street-based sex work are
OL,8,Freporting serious sexual offences after
OL,9,Fa pilot was launched to improve trust
OL,10,Fand engagement.
OL,12,FMore than 40 women who may previously
OL,13,Fhave had little or no contact with
OL,14,Fpolice are now regularly engaging with
OL,15,Fofficers through Operation Amicus, the
OL,16,Fforce said.
OL,18,FIt described the scheme, which began in
OL,19,FJanuary, as a "fundamental shift" in
OL,20,Fhow it tackles violence, exploitation
OL,21,Fand vulnerability experienced by women
OL,22,Finvolved in street-based sex work.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
