OL,3,GNEWSAMet says sex workers more willing
OL,4,Ato report crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force has faced criticism over
OL,7,Ffailings linked to convicted sex
OL,8,Foffender Simon Levy, whose victims were
OL,9,Fvulnerable and had at times engaged in
OL,10,Fstreet-based sex work.
